==Trivia==
*The examine text is based on the catchphrase used by the late British television presenter {{WP|Bruce Forsyth|Sir Bruce Forsyth}}.
*Frost dragons are similar to [[rsw:Frost_dragon|their counterparts]] on ''RuneScape 3'' in that they require training a non-Slayer skill to a relatively high level to access. Where these require level 87 Sailing, ''RuneScape 3''<nowiki/>'s version require level 85 {{RSL|Dungeoneering}}. Other than that, they had some notable differences:
**Frost dragons in ''RuneScape 3'' originally used magic, melee and dragonfire, whereas the ones in ''Old School RuneScape'' use melee and icy dragonfire.
***Due to rampant botting at the time, frost dragons were eventually reworked to also use ranged (although the dragon was still restricted to one only, meaning that it could not use all three styles) and would set up an orb that would rebound damage to the attacker if struck while it was active.
**Frost dragons in ''RuneScape 3'' shared the same weaknesses of stab and ranged attacks as most other dragons, whereas in ''Old School RuneScape'' they also have a weakness to crush and fire spells.

